Trollish is the slow, rumbling language of trolls and their kin. Words are
drawn out and deep, punctuated by grunts and growls that can make even
simple conversations sound threatening to the uninitiated.

The language reflects the trolls' patient, relentless nature. Concepts like
"hunger," "regeneration," and "territory" have dozens of nuanced variations,
while abstract ideas are expressed simply if at all.

Learning Trollish requires patience, as conversations proceed at a pace
most surface dwellers find maddening. However, those who master it may find
trolls more willing to negotiate than their fearsome reputation suggests.

Class: General
Discipline: Advanced Adventuring

